The error handler logic can be simplified for better clarity, and the comment on line 345 is misleading. The current code rejects the promise for all errors, including `EADDRINUSE`, which contradicts the comment. While rejection is the correct behavior as the caller handles it and falls back to manual entry, the code should reflect this clearly for better maintainability.

