**Bootstrap `opencode.json` on first run instead of skipping persist.**

If `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` does not exist yet, Lines 509-513 return early and no Google provider is written to disk. That leaves fresh setups without the Ctrl+T model registration even when the proxy started correctly. Treat `ENOENT` as “start from `{}`” and create the parent directory before the final write.

